{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都で握手会が開催されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいが最後の全国握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、ひとまずおつかれちゃんですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握レーンはまあやと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終始ほんわかしたレーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや、来てくださった皆さんどうもありがとうございました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の個別は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カジュアルな服装〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンダルお気に入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濡れ髪ダイスキー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じょしらく頑張ってねと言う声を沢山かけて下さいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直本当に時間が欲しくて欲しくてたまりませんが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなん言い訳にはなりませんから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やるしかないのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんちゃん〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/05/05/4227058/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台本読みますね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}